TI  - SELFormerMM: multimodal molecular representation learning via SELFIES, structure, text, and knowledge graph integration
AU  - Ulusoy, Erva
AU  - Bostancı, Şevval
AU  - Deniz, Bora Engin
AU  - Doğan, Tunca
