TI  - miRBench: novel benchmark datasets for microRNA binding site prediction that mitigate against prevalent microRNA frequency class bias
AU  - Sammut, Stephanie
AU  - Gresova, Katarina
AU  - Tzimotoudis, Dimosthenis
AU  - Marsalkova, Eva
AU  - Cechak, David
AU  - Alexiou, Panagiotis
